  49          /** @defgroup mdu_Exported_Functions_Group1 Configuration of the mdu computation unit functions
  50           *  @brief   Configuration of the mdu computation unit functions
  51           *
  52           
  53          @verbatim
  54           ===============================================================================
  55                               ##### mdu base functions #####
  56           ===============================================================================
  57          @endverbatim
  58            * @{
